### Variables: pega un token de ADMIN (el de Azure AD o el de /api/usuarios/login con el admin)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_JWT

### 1. Crear cola (válido) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "q.prueba", "durable": true, "ttlMs": 60000 }

### 2. Crear cola con nombre vacío -> 400 (validación)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### 3. Crear exchange direct -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ex.prueba", "type": "direct" }

### 4. Crear exchange con tipo inválido -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ex.malo", "type": "inventado" }

### 5. Crear binding -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exchange": "ex.prueba", "destination": "q.prueba", "destinationType": "queue", "routingKey": "prueba" }

### 6. Eliminar binding -> 200
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/bindings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exchange": "ex.prueba", "destination": "q.prueba", "destinationType": "queue", "routingKey": "prueba" }

### 7. Eliminar exchange -> 200
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/exchanges/ex.prueba
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Eliminar cola -> 200
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/queues/q.prueba
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Intentar borrar una cola del sistema -> 409
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/queues/q.reserva.creada
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Sin token -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/admin/rabbit/queues
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "q.sin.token" }
